# Entity model pipeline

When creating or fixing **mob models/textures**, read and follow:

`.cursor/skills/effecoria-entity-models/SKILL.md`

Critical for **translucent GeckoLib mobs**: solid limbs use **opaque alpha (255)**; holes are usually wrong UV or accidental transparency, not “glass”. Only designated parts use cutout alpha (see `SILHOUETTE_PARTS` in golem pack script).

Lore first: `docs/lore/`, feature docs — if no description, ask the user before generating concept art.
